# Local Worker dev overrides for `wrangler dev` (copy to `.dev.vars`).
# Groupon deal reads hit an ANONYMOUS public endpoint — there are NO app-level
# credentials, API keys, or per-user secrets anywhere in this connector. The
# only var below is an optional read-cache tuning knob mirroring the stdio
# server; you almost certainly don't need to set it.

# Response-cache TTL for repeated browse/search reads, in seconds (0 = off).
# GROUPON_CACHE_TTL=60
